;; it-fault-wrap-sd.expected.sexp — the expected observations for `it-fault-wrap-sd.s` (P2-SCALAR.4).
;; Validate with:
;;   python3 scripts/check_sexp_schema.py it-fault-wrap-sd.expected.sexp schema/expectations.sexp

(comment "it-fault-wrap-sd.expected.sexp — the expected observations for `it-fault-wrap-sd.s`." "" "⛔ EVERY VALUE HERE WAS DERIVED FROM THE PINNED SPECIFICATION PROSE BEFORE THE PROGRAM WAS RUN" "(EVD-05). The probe measured `sd` at the TOP of the address space first — and found a NEW" "reference difference there (sail-riscv 0.14 masks the access-fault tval to its 56-bit" "physical-address width; spike and semulith report the full address), recorded as" "DIFF-TVAL-PHYS-MASK in references.sexp. So this guest wraps its store address to exactly 0" "instead: below 2^56 the tval is exact on all three models, and the wrap rule is pinned on the" "store path three-way. The store modifies NOTHING (SEM-06): the boundary refuses the request," "and the recorded crossing answered AccessFault is census-pinned.")
(expectations (program "it-fault-wrap-sd.s") (entry "0x80000000") (instructions 3) (step (n 0) (insn "addi x1, x0, -8") (writes (write (reg "x1") (value "0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF8"))) (derivation "The 12-bit immediate -8 sign-extends: x1 = 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF8 — the base eight bytes below the wrap point, 8-aligned so the misalignment question never arises.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4 (D-ALU-IMM: the immediate sign-extends)")) (step (n 1) (insn "addi x2, x0, 7") (writes (write (reg "x2") (value "0x0000000000000007"))) (derivation "The store data — an ordinary write, so the trap is not the only step.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 2) (insn "sd x2, 8, x1") (writes) (derivation "The effective address is (rs1 + sext(imm)) mod 2^64 = 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF8 + 8 = 0 — the wrap (D-ADDR-WRAP, on the store path). Address 0 belongs to no declared region, so the store raises store-access-fault: cause 0x07, tval = 0x0000000000000000 — and nothing is modified: a failing access stores no byte (SEM-06). A store writes no register, so the expectation is the empty writes table; the one crossing of the run (the refused store at 0) is census-pinned.") (source "RVI-RV64I §3.1.3; RVI-INTRO, Memory (D-ADDR-WRAP); RVI-RV32I §1.1.6 (D-ADDRESS-SPACE)")))
